#META 2026-11-24^November 20, 2026^May 2026 to October 2026 ¶ #NOTE 0~USCIS posts 1 processing time for any service center location that processes requests for an Employment Authorization Document based on a pending asylum application. We keep these requests in an electronic system that allows us generally to process adjudication-ready cases in the order USCIS receives them, regardless of where the case is pending or where the adjudicator is. ¶ #NOTE 1~USCIS posts 1 processing time for any service center location that processes requests for an initial Employment Authorization Document based on a pending asylum application. We keep these requests in an electronic system that allows us generally to process adjudication-ready cases in the order USCIS receives them, regardless of where the case is pending or where the adjudicator is. ¶ #OFF SCD~Service Center Operations (SCOPS) ¶ #OFF NBC~National Benefits Center ¶ @I-765^147-539C26^Based on being an H-4 spouse of an H-1B nonimmigrant (filed with I-539 H4) [(c)(26)]|SCD:7:2026-01-18:- ¶ @I-765^147-A18^Based on being an L-2 spouse of an L-1 nonimmigrant [(a)(18)]|SCD:18:2025-04-01:- ¶ @I-765^147-A3^Based on being admitted as a Refugee [(a)(3)]|SCD:1W:2025-02-12:- ¶ @I-765^147-A5^Based on an approved asylum application [(a)(5)]|SCD:2:2025-06-26:- ¶ @I-765^147-C10^Application for Suspension of Deportation/Sec.244/NACARA/Cancel of Removal [(c)(10)]|NBC:13:2025-04-01:- ¶ @I-765^147-C11^Based on parole|NBC:16.5:2025-04-04:- ¶ @I-765^147-C18^Alien with Final Order of Deportation Under an OSUP [(c)(18)]|NBC:17.5:2025-05-01:- ¶ @I-765^147-C26^Based on being an H-4 spouse of an H-1B nonimmigrant (Standalone; not filed with I-539 H4) [(c)(26)]|SCD:18.5:2025-04-22:- ¶ @I-765^147-C3^Based on a request by a qualified F-1 academic student [(c)(3)]|SCD:6:2026-05-09:- ¶ @I-765^147-C8^Based on a pending asylum application [(c)(8)] -renewal/replacement|SCD:19:2025-02-11:0 ¶ @I-765^147-C8I^Based on a pending asylum application [(c)(8)] – I